Run one child at a time. Fan out only for independent pieces where waiting is
the real cost, and say why first.
{% endif %}
{% if agent in ["codex", "claude"] %}
Run at most two children at once; ask before running more.
{% endif %}

## Feedback loops

- Before editing, run the fastest check that covers the change for a baseline;
  reproduce a bug before fixing it.
- Iterate change → fast check; run the full suite once at the end.
- If no fast check exists, say so and propose one.
- On non-trivial work, show me the plan or first small slice before building
  the rest.
